Listen to Text
Cut Text into Chars
Put 0 into Length
While Chars
Roll Chars into Letter
Build Length up

Put false into Won
If Length is 2
Put true into Won

If Length is 3
Put true into Won

If Length is 5
Put true into Won

If Length is 7
Put true into Won

If Length is 11
Put true into Won

If Length is 13
Put true into Won

If Length is 17
Put true into Won

If Length is 19
Put true into Won

If Length is 23
Put true into Won

If Length is 29
Put true into Won

If Won
Say "You win the game, congratulation !"
Else
Say "Try again..."
